WEBVTT

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:22.750
What are you divining for?

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:27.740
The light on the sword has already
reached the halfway point.

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:32.260
This omen means calamity may fall upon us.

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:36.530
Based on the light's positioning
at 3/10ths down the sword,

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:39.490
we may only have three
to five years of peace remaining.

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:46.400
After which will follow, the Age of Mappo.

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:50.820
The Age of Mappo?

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:53.240
Chief, are you sure?

00:00:53.600 --> 00:01:00.280
I've accurately foretold the future using
this Year Sword, countless times.

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:03.080
Year Sword?

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:04.540
But it says "Tea Sword".

00:01:07.310 --> 00:01:11.550
Obu, there's something I've always
been meaning to tell you...

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:13.200
Don't change the subject!

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.470
How many times do I have
to tell you to wear your glasses!?

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:16.890
You senile old geezer!

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:18.010
That's too much...

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:21.080
You should resign and let me lead the clan!

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:24.520
How could someone like you, possibly lead the clan!?

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:44.890
What was that just now?

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:46.250
Meteors?

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:47.830
Does that mean everything will be okay?

00:01:48.540 --> 00:01:52.950
I think the land of the Nine Regions
just missed the Age of Mappo.

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:57.370
As far as I can tell, what's coming
is not the Age of Mappo, but..

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:02.470
Meanwhile, in a small remote village,

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:05.980
was born a time-travelled soul.

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:11.850
What should've been a disaster turned
out to be a blessing in disguise.

00:02:11.850 --> 00:02:14.250
Twelve years transpired,

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:19.490
along with most people's memories
of the meteors that night.

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:28.500
What followed came to be known
as the Golden Age of Cultivation.

00:02:30.530 --> 00:02:37.440
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:07.570
We drew a scribbled map of the future with no defined end

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:14.270
But you smiled saying, "no matter how lost we get,

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:17.790
or how much we cry, the end will come"

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:24.950
If tomorrow was an untouched white canvas

00:03:25.420 --> 00:03:30.660
I'd like to see what kind of colors would shine the brightest

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:35.010
Like tears leaving behind a rainbow

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:40.950
I'll prove to you I can change this world

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:45.280
Let us paint the sky with a rainbow of colors

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:48.320
Listening to the footsteps of a tomorrow

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:52.500
whose name we've yet to know

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:08.850
I don't care what royal family you come from, or who you are,

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:11.400
this town is governed by the Divine clan.

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:13.680
I've told you that the inn is full, and that's that!

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:16.150
Even the princess is staying
in the stables with the horses.

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:22.530
You'll have no choice but to follow the rules,
if you want to stay in the VIP room.

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:28.010
The day before yesterday, there was this guy
who tried to force his way into the VIP room.

00:04:28.010 --> 00:04:30.540
He died at the mercy of
our clans' member's hands.

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:33.580
Shut up! You think we'd believe such a story?

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:35.670
Open the door and let our Master in!

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:41.680
Is there a problem?

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:43.510
Should we kill him too?

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:47.760
Don't bother, I was just teaching
these newcomers a lesson.

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:52.270
It seems you are unaware that
the contest has already begun.

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:55.970
The test starts the instant you enter this town.

00:04:55.970 --> 00:04:57.650
It's the new rule for this year.

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:02.570
Excuse me,

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:08.440
you mentioned that there's a special
condition to enter the VIP room, right?

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:12.330
In other words, I can stay there
if I fulfill the requirements.

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:15.340
What a sharp kid.

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:17.530
You're right. If you want to access the VIP room,

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:19.250
you must obtain the "Special Access" ticket.

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:20.940
Special Access ticket?

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:24.800
Unfortunately, there's only
one ticket in the entire town.

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:27.390
Where can we get it?

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:29.200
Hell if I know.

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:33.500
Like the clansmen just said,

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:36.570
the challenge started the moment
you stepped foot in this town.

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:39.880
It looks like we need to complete
a specific quest to obtain it.

00:05:39.880 --> 00:05:44.860
I can chalk up some points for the contest,
on top of being able to stay in the VIP room.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:47.610
I see, so that's how it is.

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:49.990
Is this the Special Access ticket?

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:54.660
This allows me to stay in the VIP room, right?

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:56.540
So that's the ticket.

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:04.960
Well then, make yourself at home.

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:08.910
Don't mind if I do.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:13.600
There's only one in the whole town.

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:15.020
What a shame.

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:16.980
How did he get it?

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:19.850
These are all nice goods.

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:21.610
Here's the money.

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:38.910
I didn't ask for room service.

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:44.590
He must've sensed my footsteps, despite the rain.

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:51.020
My name is Kaiunho, from the Untai Empire.

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:53.470
And I'm here to take part in the contest as well.

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:58.100
I just happened to take a glance at the guest book,

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:01.430
Your name is Oriku, isn't it?

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:02.460
What do you want from me?

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:06.120
Do you mind telling me how you managed
to get that Special Access ticket?

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:09.110
Um...

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:16.660
I'll tell you if you agree to be my servant for a day.

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:22.210
Sure, if it's only for a day.

00:07:22.640 --> 00:07:24.680
Come in, come in, Kai-chan!

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:27.210
Let me tell you of my heroic deeds.

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:29.720
He's totally been dying to tell someone.

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:31.800
When I arrived at the town gate,

00:07:31.800 --> 00:07:34.720
there was a chattering old man.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:36.720
But no one could get what he was saying,

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:38.740
so nobody paid attention to him.

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:43.730
Maybe he isn't looking for someone
to talk to, I thought to myself.

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:46.500
He must've been thirsty from talking so much,

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:48.110
so I gave him some water.

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:52.950
Ah, I also gave that old man some water.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.960
He didn't seem to be satisfied,

00:07:54.960 --> 00:07:56.470
so I took him to a dessert shop.

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:57.350
He wanted to flirt with the girl.

00:07:59.160 --> 00:07:59.750
Flirt?

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:02.620
He didn't have the guts to hit on her alone.

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:05.880
So I wing-manned him while
pretending to buy some dessert.

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:14.430
The old guy was so happy, he gave me the ticket.

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:15.930
Unbelievable.

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:20.180
I'll bet this much.

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:21.760
That's a lot.

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:24.910
Did you forget how badly you lost last time?

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:28.190
What do you wanna bet this time?

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:33.840
If you can sell more than a hundred
radishes in a single day, you win.

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:35.480
But if you lose,

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:37.700
you have to return to the Reiken Sect with me.

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:40.220
Only one hundred radishes?

00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:41.500
Easy win.

00:08:42.260 --> 00:08:45.250
There's one more condition...

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:51.300
Who the heck is gonna buy
such expensive radishes?

00:08:51.300 --> 00:08:53.760
Shouldn't have agreed to
that sly guy's bet so easily.

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:58.570
Ah, it's nice out.

00:08:58.570 --> 00:08:59.810
Kai-chan, hurry up.

00:09:00.110 --> 00:09:02.770
I'm trying, but it's kinda heavy.

00:09:03.790 --> 00:09:06.020
Morning, Miss Innkeeper.

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:07.640
What's going on?

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:09.600
You're selling radishes,

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:11.160
did the inn go out of business?

00:09:11.160 --> 00:09:13.340
You tryin' to pick a fight with me!?

00:09:13.340 --> 00:09:14.950
Young Master!

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:18.200
Are you okay?

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:19.670
Ochu you idiot,

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:21.550
what took you so long?

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:22.750
Young Master,

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:24.120
I finally made it!

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:29.820
We were ambushed by bandits at the town entry. They took everything.

00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:32.130
Even all the goods Master sent with us.

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:34.380
Young Master, I'm really sorry!

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:34.380
Miss Innkeeper,

00:09:35.460 --> 00:09:37.800
I'll help you sell those radishes.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.230
In exchange,

00:09:39.230 --> 00:09:42.230
you'll take care of my meals
before the start of the contest.

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:43.060
Sounds good?

00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:44.800
Interesting.

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:46.060
You've got yourself a deal.

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:51.530
This town situated at the foot of the mountain is blessed by the mighty Reiken.

00:09:51.530 --> 00:09:54.570
Quite naturally, there would be some special produce.

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:59.390
For example, these Kinrei radishes infused with
nutrition supplements endorsed by the Reiken Sect.

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:01.830
Specialty of the Ryoka Inn!

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:08.330
We are offering a limited time discount to celebrate
the start of the contest. Only 998 ryo for one!

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:10.340
It looks tasty.

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:12.380
But a bit too pricey.

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:13.620
What should we do?

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:15.820
We don't have enough money for the three of us.

00:10:15.820 --> 00:10:17.090
Let's buy one and share it?

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:19.440
They're not gonna sell at this rate.

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:22.630
It's the Young Master's plan.

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:25.890
It may seem crazy, but it always works out.

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:28.860
Ah, there he is!

00:10:29.170 --> 00:10:29.960
Come one, come all!

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:31.610
Don't miss out!

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:34.370
I'd like to purchase all the radishes.

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:36.410
Our valued customer...

00:10:36.410 --> 00:10:38.070
Our radishes...

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:39.950
There's a limit to three per person.

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:42.870
This customer knows what's best.

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.620
May I ask who you are, exactly?

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:48.170
Aren't you the one who successfully
completed the quest,

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:51.000
and won the Special Access ticket? Oriku-sama?

00:10:55.130 --> 00:10:58.010
As contestants in the Celestial Gathering,

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:03.890
you all must've heard about
the requirements on the Spirit Base.

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:07.960
Although you can easily take
some pills to gain the Spirit Base,

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:10.150
there's a lot more to it.

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:13.040
In addition to having no former training,

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:18.690
your Spirit Base must be pure and spotless.

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:25.910
According to my research, these Kinrei radishes have the ability to purify your spirit base.

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:31.440
Such magical items should be
sold for 10 000 ryo a piece.

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:36.170
In fact, you'd be a fool to miss out
on this incredible offer.

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:38.090
I've gotta get one!

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:48.310
As promised, I've prepared a hearty meal for you.

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:51.270
Wow! Young Master, this looks delicious!

00:11:51.270 --> 00:11:53.020
Take your time and enjoy your meal.

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:57.080
It's all you'll be getting from me
before the challenge really commences.

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:58.690
There's still three days left!

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:00.480
You're so stingy!

00:12:00.480 --> 00:12:02.450
This isn't gonna be enough for three days.

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:05.200
I also have a gift for you,

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:07.160
as a token of my appreciation.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.140
It's just a small pouch!

00:12:09.140 --> 00:12:10.120
You really are stingy!

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:12.970
If you don't like it, you can always throw it away.

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:19.420
A key and a copper coin.

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:22.630
Could this be the key to her room?

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:25.970
Maybe she wants to pay you back with her body!

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:27.920
Ochu!

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:30.560
I never realized you were that kind of person.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:33.000
I was just kidding, Young Master!

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.690
Don't take it so seriously!

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:44.570
I'm looking forward to seeing
how that kid performs in the contest.

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:54.870
The food lasted us for three days,
yet it somehow stayed fresh and tasty.

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:58.400
Must be because of the containers they were stored in.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:01.630
Young Master, wait for me!

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:08.760
There's so many people crowded here.

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:09.790
Look!

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:11.180
Something is flying over there!

00:13:18.780 --> 00:13:22.030
From here on out, the Celestial
Gathering has officially begun!

00:13:22.450 --> 00:13:26.700
Only those who pass all tests,
will be able to join our clan.

00:13:26.700 --> 00:13:29.450
The challenges will be difficult.

00:13:30.230 --> 00:13:31.880
For the first test,

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:34.040
you must cross this golden bridge.

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:38.000
It will be your first step into
the "World of Cultivation".

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.170
Piece of cake!

00:13:40.350 --> 00:13:41.420
Little Master, here we go!

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:43.010
We're gonna be the first ones to finish!

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:46.890
A barrier?

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:47.730
But, look!

00:13:47.730 --> 00:13:49.640
That guy is safe on the bridge.

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:53.510
Only those twelve and under may enter.

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:56.390
Anyone older, please step back.

00:13:57.090 --> 00:13:58.940
I can't carry all this luggage on my own.

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:02.250
What am I gonna do? We can't
go back to our hometown either.

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:05.340
Guess I'll have to find a job here.

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:07.190
Chu-chan, let's go.

00:14:07.190 --> 00:14:07.950
Okay.

00:14:10.060 --> 00:14:13.200
How many people do you think
will pass the test, this year?

00:14:13.200 --> 00:14:16.370
Based on past experience, I'd say 2 or 3. But...

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:20.790
Yeah I almost forgot. Probably not gonna
happen when the test was created by her.

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:27.170
I just hope that it doesn't
turn into a total disaster.

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:28.590
O-san,

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:30.800
wait a second.

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:33.720
I can't believe that you're under 12.

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:34.970
You look like you're at least 15.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.610
Yeah, well...

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:40.440
If you've got nothing else to say,
I'm gonna go ahead.

00:14:41.930 --> 00:14:43.830
Wanna go together?

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:44.910
With you?

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:45.960
Yes.

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:47.280
Let's help each other.

00:14:48.090 --> 00:14:51.660
The contest will be rigorous and dangerous.

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:52.920
However,

00:14:52.920 --> 00:14:55.830
if we're partners, we can help each other out.

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:57.960
It'd be beneficial for the both of us.

00:14:57.960 --> 00:14:59.910
Help each other out?

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:03.290
Do you seriously think I need help?

00:15:11.320 --> 00:15:13.210
Just kidding!

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:17.470
I'm pretty sure I'd be fine on my own.

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:20.100
However, I'm willing to give you a hand.

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:23.400
Even after we become fellow
clansmen, I'll look after you!

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:26.900
You're about as weak as Chu-chan.

00:15:29.210 --> 00:15:33.030
Can I do this on my own?

00:15:33.810 --> 00:15:35.990
Well if you insist,

00:15:36.440 --> 00:15:39.160
I don't mind having some friends tag along.

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:40.660
Friends?

00:15:41.030 --> 00:15:44.590
Young Master, slow down a bit.

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:46.250
Ah, sorry.

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:48.510
Watch where you're going!

00:15:48.510 --> 00:15:51.790
You can only be on this bridge
if you're 12 and under, right!?

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:53.390
What is this monster doing here?

00:15:53.760 --> 00:15:56.150
Ahh, I'm sorry!

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:58.360
You dare to hit me!?

00:15:58.880 --> 00:16:02.130
Hey, you, let him go.

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:03.770
Don't order me around!

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:07.150
Wait aren't you...?

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:08.900
Wow, so fast.

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:12.530
Amazing! Young Master scared the monster off.

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:16.830
No, the one who scared off the guy wasn't me.

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:17.700
Hm?

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:19.030
Huh?

00:16:19.030 --> 00:16:21.160
Chu-chan, let's get going.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:21.620
Yeah!

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:24.600
Kai-chan, is there something
you're forgetting to tell me?

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:25.960
No, nothing at all.

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:28.630
Wait, hold on Young Master!

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:36.480
This is too heavy.

00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:37.720
Are you listening?

00:16:40.370 --> 00:16:45.020
Walking on the bridge is easy enough,
but you can barely see the other end.

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:47.510
The fog is thickening.

00:16:47.510 --> 00:16:49.520
It's getting harder and harder to see the ground.

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:51.810
How long do we have left to go?

00:16:51.810 --> 00:16:53.900
Are they intentionally misleading us?

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:56.030
Not doing it. I can't take the fog anymore.

00:16:56.690 --> 00:16:59.230
Seems there are already people giving up.

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:03.040
Fewer participants, means
fewer people for us to protect.

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:07.920
This is a cursed fountain.

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:09.850
What do you mean?

00:17:09.850 --> 00:17:12.550
If you want to take some water,

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:15.560
this is what happens.

00:17:15.560 --> 00:17:17.300
It seems you need to pay for it with gold.

00:17:17.850 --> 00:17:20.060
How do you know that?

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:23.420
Because it says "exchange".

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:25.500
Just now, someone threw in a gold coin,

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:27.650
and some water came out from the bamboo funnel.

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:29.430
Ah, I see.

00:17:29.430 --> 00:17:32.910
"True knowledge comes from practice".

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:35.570
However, you missed the underlying mechanism.

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:37.090
What?

00:17:37.090 --> 00:17:39.070
What do you mean?

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:40.280
Oh crap!

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:42.580
He dumped dirt from his shoe into the water!?

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:44.410
What the hell do you think you're doing!?

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:46.920
Hold on, take a look at the bamboo funnel.

00:17:48.280 --> 00:17:49.210
Gold!

00:17:52.660 --> 00:17:54.550
From the dirt?

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:58.760
Has nobody noticed the conversion chart
of the Five Elements at the bottom?

00:17:59.190 --> 00:18:01.740
Water flows to let trees grow.

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:08.440
The wood is used to feed fire,
and the ashes become the dust of the earth.

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:12.500
The depths of the earth
form minerals, such as gold.

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:16.450
You can only find metals by excavating the earth.

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:20.570
And on the surface of the gold
you will find water from the frost.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:25.620
To test it out, I dropped
some dirt into the fountain.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:27.440
As you can see, the results speak for themselves.

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:29.960
The fountain is really a converter for the Five Elements.

00:18:30.740 --> 00:18:32.240
The concept is pretty simple.

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:36.060
It might even be a toy for the clan elder's daughter.

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:43.880
Well thank you very much for the explanation,
but we're not thirsty, so it's useless to us!

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:47.550
Wait, let's think about what's going on here.

00:18:47.550 --> 00:18:52.310
This is a test, there's no way
this would randomly be placed here.

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:55.660
Maybe we have to transport
the water to the next test?

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:57.150
It could be a part of the mission.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:59.800
Harvest the water?

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:01.640
But we have no gold.

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:04.700
Should we go back to town to get some soil?

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:07.540
Don't you realize where we are right now?

00:19:08.490 --> 00:19:09.500
The Golden Bridge!

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:12.490
There's no rule that says we can't take some.

00:19:12.490 --> 00:19:15.000
This is the most efficient way.

00:19:16.000 --> 00:19:19.100
It's pretty hard.

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:22.230
If we dig hard enough, it might be worth enough to cover our travel expenses too, let's dig hard!

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:23.510
This isn't possible!

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:26.500
We're not gonna dig too?

00:19:26.500 --> 00:19:28.480
Chu-chan, open the pack.

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:30.020
Okay.

00:19:33.140 --> 00:19:34.650
Awesome!

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:38.610
She gave us the containers
to use with this, didn't she?

00:19:38.610 --> 00:19:40.280
It's all thanks to the innkeeper.

00:19:41.650 --> 00:19:42.740
Are you leaving already?

00:19:43.330 --> 00:19:45.150
I'm returning the containers you lent to me.

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:48.260
The containers are plated with gold.

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:53.040
Take it, you might be able to
turn it into water somewhere.

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:57.840
<i>The innkeeper must be related to the clan.</i>

00:19:58.140 --> 00:20:01.340
<i>She might even be one of the clan members.</i>

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:05.730
This boy found a way to skip the digging.

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:08.850
He's racking up a lot of points on the others.

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:12.940
What's more, he managed
to get some help from Rei-chan.

00:20:12.940 --> 00:20:15.360
Which means he also has luck on his side.

00:20:16.830 --> 00:20:24.490
Regardless, it won't be so easy to pass this
meticulously designed test, with luck alone.

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:28.490
Let's see how far you can go.

00:20:28.890 --> 00:20:31.000
Slow and steady now.

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:33.950
Don't lose a single drop.

00:20:33.950 --> 00:20:34.880
Yes sir!

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:46.470
It would be faster to just take it all at once.

00:20:52.970 --> 00:20:54.520
Looks like it's time for us to step in.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:55.440
I agree.

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:09.720
Young Master,

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:11.850
I'm exhausted.

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:14.870
Go on ahead without me.

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:21.000
Get some rest, and then catch up with us.

00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:23.300
Young Master.

00:21:24.180 --> 00:21:26.790
I won't ever abandon you, don't worry.

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:27.840
Just don't slow me down.

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:30.810
Run!

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:34.480
Kai-chan, grab Chu-chan, quickly!

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:36.140
Got it!

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:45.820
Young Master!

00:21:50.890 --> 00:21:52.080
Slow and steady.

00:22:18.030 --> 00:22:23.750
The beat that quivers
within my worn down memory,

00:22:24.180 --> 00:22:27.220
Drowns in my slumber,

00:22:27.390 --> 00:22:29.060
sinking below the surface

00:22:29.360 --> 00:22:35.080
My eyes, as they
look up to a pouring sky

00:22:35.470 --> 00:22:40.480
Reflect a heart locked
away by the moonlight

00:22:40.820 --> 00:22:51.330
Only my most twisted pain
lies within this weaving infinity

00:22:51.560 --> 00:22:57.770
Bleeding away miserably
as our intertwined fingers untangle

00:22:58.110 --> 00:23:01.500
Clinging to your feelings,

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:04.700
oh so powerfully

00:23:05.090 --> 00:23:10.260
I'll show you I can go
beyond this rusted world

00:23:10.790 --> 00:23:15.850
The words that pierced
through this permanent illusion

00:23:16.110 --> 00:23:25.950
Resound through my out stretched fingers

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:37.570
"At the End of Togen".

00:23:37.570 --> 00:23:39.350
Waiting for you at the Reiken Mountain.
